      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effect of nifedipine on exercise left ventricular function and coronary haemodynamics was studied in a group of patients with coronary artery disease. Nifedipine, unlike nitroglycerin, appears to act as a primary coronary vasodilator and was able to reverse exercise induced changes in ventricular function."},
